1
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:18,470
This is a supplemental video presentation for the case animal and plant biotechnology course.
这是 CASE 动物与植物生物技术课程的补充视频讲解。

2
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:23,470
As you view this video, be sure to make notes of important information.
观看本视频时，请务必记下重要信息。

3
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:30,490
Feel free to pause, repeat, and resume the video whenever necessary.
必要时可以随时暂停、重播和继续播放视频。

4
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:36,490
Lab notebooks, lesson 1.1, Foundations of Biotechnology.
实验记录本　第 1.1 课　生物技术基础。

5
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:41,490
You completed activity 1.1.1, Defining Biotechnology,
你已经完成了活动 1.1.1“定义生物技术”，

6
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:45,490
during which you explored the many applications of biotechnology.
其间你探索了生物技术的众多应用。

7
00:00:45,490 --> 00:00:50,490
For previous courses, you utilized a binder to organize course materials.
在以前的课程中，你用活页夹来整理课程资料。

8
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:59,490
For the animal and plant biotechnology course, you will also use a new organizational tool, the laboratory notebook.
在动物与植物生物技术课程中，你还将使用一种新的整理工具：实验记录本。

9
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:06,490
This presentation provides information about how to set up your notebook and make entries throughout this course.
本讲解介绍如何建立你的记录本，以及在整个课程中如何做记录。

10
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:19,380
Part 2 of activity 1.1.2, Biotechnology notebooks, will walk you through the process of setting up your laboratory notebook.
活动 1.1.2“生物技术记录本”的第 2 部分将带你一步步建立实验记录本。

11
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:24,380
You will also use the laboratory notebook guidelines document.
你还会用到实验记录本指南文件。

12
00:01:24,380 --> 00:01:27,380
First, set up the table of contents.
首先，建立目录。

13
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:33,380
Each entry should include the first page for each experiment and the first date for each experiment.
每个条目应包括每个实验的起始页码和每个实验的开始日期。

14
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:37,380
Leave through page 6 for the table of contents.
把第 6 页之前的页面留作目录。

15
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:45,620
You will record your first experiment's protocol beginning on page 7.
你将从第 7 页开始记录第一个实验的方案。

16
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:53,620
This will most likely be activity 1.2.3, Making Percent Solutions.
这很可能是活动 1.2.3“配制百分比浓度溶液”。

17
00:01:53,620 --> 00:02:04,620
On each page of your notebook, you must have a page number, the title of your experiment, the date, your signature, and initials of a classmate verifying your records.
记录本的每一页上都必须有页码、实验标题、日期、你的签名，以及核实你记录的同学的姓名缩写。

18
00:02:04,620 --> 00:02:15,380
Each lab entry needs to include a purpose, materials, quantities, and procedures for the experiment.
每条实验记录都需要包括实验的目的、材料、用量和步骤。

19
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:21,380
Record data such as reactions, conditions, and environmental factors in your notebook.
把反应、条件和环境因素等数据记录在记录本中。

20
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:26,380
Results, analysis, and conclusions will complete each experiment.
每个实验最后以结果、分析和结论收尾。

21
00:02:26,380 --> 00:02:36,780
Recognizing that many experiments will take more than one class period to complete, or may require more than one page,
考虑到许多实验需要不止一节课才能完成，或者可能需要不止一页，

22
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:40,780
a system of numbering is used on every page of the notebook.
记录本的每一页都采用编号系统。

23
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:49,780
Any experiment that continues on a later page should include the phrase, go to page on the bottom right.
任何在后面页面继续的实验，都应在右下角写上“转至第……页”。

24
00:02:49,780 --> 00:02:57,780
The phrase from page should be written at the top left of each page of a continued experiment.
在续写实验的每一页左上角，应写上“接第……页”。

25
00:02:57,780 --> 00:03:04,310
Experiment pages may be separated by pages used to record other experiments,
同一实验的各页之间可能隔着记录其他实验的页面，

26
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:08,310
but you should never leave entire blank pages in the notebook.
但记录本中绝不能留下整页空白。

27
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:17,310
If a page is not completely filled, you should draw a slash through the white space, then sign and date the slash.
如果某一页没有写满，应在空白处画一道斜线，然后在斜线上签名并注明日期。

28
00:03:17,310 --> 00:03:24,740
The laboratory notebook is used in industry to record precise protocol and data.
在工业界，实验记录本用来记录精确的实验方案和数据。

29
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:32,740
An accurate record of steps in an experiment will assist you and others in repeating the experiment to verify results.
准确记录实验步骤，有助于你和他人重复实验以验证结果。

30
00:03:33,740 --> 00:03:41,740
Information contained within laboratory notebooks is also used to compile primary data for research articles and reports.
实验记录本中的信息还会被用来汇编研究论文和报告的原始数据。

31
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:46,740
These can be used to prove a patentable product or procedure.
这些记录可以用来证明某种产品或方法具有可专利性。

32
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:54,740
At the end of this course, you will be completing a unique and independent investigation, then reporting your results.
在本课程结束时，你将完成一项独特的独立研究，然后报告你的结果。

33
00:03:54,740 --> 00:04:00,740
Your laboratory notebook will be a critical part of this inquiry activity.
你的实验记录本将是这项探究活动中至关重要的一部分。

34
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:10,220
Throughout the course, your teacher will use the laboratory notebook evaluation rubric to provide feedback before your notebook entries.
在整个课程中，老师会使用实验记录本评分标准，对你的记录本条目提供反馈。

35
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:17,220
Keep the guidelines document and evaluation rubric available when you discuss any questions you have with your teacher.
在与老师讨论任何问题时，请把指南文件和评分标准放在手边。
